---

This repository packages the upstream Pulsarr application
(https://github.com/jamcalli/Pulsarr) as a Home Assistant add-on. The Pulsarr
application itself is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
(AGPL-3.0) by jamcalli and is NOT covered by this MIT license. The MIT license
above applies only to the add-on packaging files (Dockerfile, run.sh, config.yaml,
documentation, CI workflows) authored by this repository's contributors.

When the add-on container is built, it pulls the official `lakker/pulsarr` image
as its base layer. That image and all code inside it remain under AGPL-3.0.
